  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1000486904/v0.2.177</id>
    <updated>2026-11-03T02:17:57Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.177"/>
    <title>v0.2.177</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;New Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;on_failure&lt;/code&gt; option for &lt;code&gt;HookMatcher&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Control what happens when a hook callback fails. Set &lt;code&gt;on_failure=&quot;block&quot;&lt;/code&gt; to block the action when a callback raises, returns &lt;code&gt;None&lt;/code&gt;, or returns a value the CLI rejects. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;&quot;continue&quot;&lt;/code&gt; (treat failure as no decision). Requires a CLI version that supports this option; connecting to an older CLI with &lt;code&gt;on_failure=&quot;block&quot;&lt;/code&gt; raises &lt;code&gt;CLIConnectionError&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6106156344&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/issues/1460&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/pull/1460/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/pull/1460&quot;&gt;#1460&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Internal/Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.317&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tests: e2e tests now accept either &lt;code&gt;Bash&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;PowerShell&lt;/code&gt; tool in shell-dependent tests, fixing intermittent failures on Windows (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6167116652&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/issues/1467&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/pull/1467/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/pull/1467&quot;&gt;#1467&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PyPI:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.177/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.177/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto&quot; data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=&quot;pip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.177&quot;&gt;&lt;pre&gt;pip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.177&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content>
